      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 Google Sheet Schema\n\n**Sheet name:** `API Keys`\n\n| api_key | owner | daily_limit | daily_count | last_reset | active |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| abc123xyz | Alice | 5 | 2 | 2026-07-08 | yes |\n| def456uvw | Bob | 5 | 0 | 2000-01-01 | no |\n\n⚠️ Column header names must match exactly (case-sensitive, underscores).\n\n`last_reset` uses ISO date format: `YYYY-MM-DD`\nThe workflow resets `daily_count` to 0 automatically when `last_reset` < today.",
